; The capsule's configuration, one Configure datom per line, applied in order
; over the capsule's meta socket. @SOURCE_ROOT@ and @CAPSULE_RUNTIME@ are
; filled by flow-capsule with its own source root and runtime directory;
; @CURRICULUM_SOCKET@ is the socket of the capsule's own Curriculum Nexus;
; @HERDR_SESSION@ is the capsule's own Herdr session, where every launch
; opens its pane.
; The stable Codex endpoint is the capsule's own app-server, serving
; @CODEX_MODEL@ for { Mind test Terra }; the next endpoint names no
; models. No Message Nexus is named. Each permaflow carries
; its leave-outs, after its workspace, of the harness its Model runs on.
; A Claude seat runs the flow-hook beside the Nexus on the events the
; running Flow configures.
Configure.Nexus.{ @SOURCE_ROOT@ { @CODEX_CLIENT@ @CODEX_HOME@ @CODEX_SOCKET@ [ @CODEX_MODEL@ ] } { @CAPSULE_RUNTIME@/no-codex-client @CAPSULE_RUNTIME@/codex-next @CAPSULE_RUNTIME@/codex-next.sock [] } [ { Claude [ / «!» # ] [ esc esc ] [ enter ] } { Codex [ / «!» ] [ esc ] [] } ] [ Psyche ] None None @CURRICULUM_SOCKET@ 60 None @HERDR_SESSION@ }
Configure.Models.[ { Fable claude-haiku-5-5 } { Opus claude-haiku-5-5 } { Sonnet claude-haiku-5-5 } { Haiku claude-haiku-5-5 } { Terra @CODEX_MODEL@ } ]
Configure.Thresholds.[ { claude-haiku-5-5 200000 } { @CODEX_MODEL@ 200000 } ]
Configure.DefaultMinutes.30
Configure.HarnessHookEvents.[ SessionStart PostToolUse UserPromptSubmit Stop SessionEnd ]
Configure.Metaflows.[ { { Psyche test Opus } None [ ClaudeAiConnectors ExplorePlanAgents WorkflowTool SkillTool BundledSkills ScheduleWakeupTool ReportFindingsTool ListAgentsTool CronTools DeferredTools ClaudeMd GitInstructions ] [ spirit:knowing:0 intent:work:0 ] [] Simplified Explicit.[] Maintained Automatic «» [] Default } { { Psyche test Sonnet } None [ ClaudeAiConnectors ExplorePlanAgents WorkflowTool SkillTool BundledSkills ScheduleWakeupTool ReportFindingsTool ListAgentsTool CronTools DeferredTools ClaudeMd GitInstructions ] [ spirit:knowing:0 intent:work:0 ] [] Regular Default OnDemand Automatic «» [] Default } { { Psyche test Haiku } None [ ClaudeAiConnectors ExplorePlanAgents WorkflowTool SkillTool BundledSkills ScheduleWakeupTool ReportFindingsTool ListAgentsTool CronTools DeferredTools ClaudeMd GitInstructions ] [ spirit:knowing:0 intent:work:0 ] [] Simplified Explicit.[] OnDemand Automatic «» [] Default } { { Mind test Terra } None [ CodexAgentsMd CodexSkillListing CodexCollaborationMode CodexEnvironmentContext CodexPermissions CodexDeveloperInstructions ] [ spirit:knowing:0 intent:work:0 ] [] Simplified Explicit.[] OnDemand Automatic «» [] Default } ]
